 <h3>FHIR Releases and Versioning</h3>
 
-<p>
-New versions of FHIR are published in an ongoing basis.  The time between publications is based on the timelines necessary
-to consult with implementers, to develop and review new content, as well as to undertake the formal balloting and reconciliation
-processes required for ANSI-approved standards.  This release cycle also ensures an opportunity to incorporate implementer
-feedback from earlier versions of the specification into subsequent versions. Limited-scope releases on a shorter timeline
-may occur occasionally where necessary to meet implementer needs.
-</p>
